n your drains to keep fruit flies away, and spiders hate citrus, so wipe down your walls and floors with citrus oil or citrus peels.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "List"}, {"shortCode": "DbFpYC9p5j8", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbFpYC9p5j8/", "caption": "Which trick will you try first? \ud83c\udf3b save this video to bring that hotel feeling home x \n1. Start with your mattress, remove stains instantly using shaving cream \n2. Then vacuum your mattress to rid dust mites and odours\n3. Mix 1 cup water, 1 tbs rubbing alcohol and vanilla oil to clean dust from your bedsides (leave out the essential oil if you have pets!)\n4. And you can use this mix as a linen spray for ongoing fragrance \n5. And you guys know how much I love to heat lemon, rosemary, clove and vanilla to make your room smell incredible \n\nWhich one is your favourite? Hope these were helpful lovelies xx \n\n#bedroommakeover #homefragrance #hometips #homehacks #tipsandtricks", "timestamp": "2026-07-22T08:22:31.000Z", "videoDuration": 23.6, "videoPlayCount": 287612, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 4796, "commentsCount": 29, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/755264137_18101650634190993_7746453329349717573_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gFhEv65GtpaEGqi6DKIFSF8S8onEOCRJCOxCR9S672w95x4wiB3yYoSugV2F3fldIM&_nc_ohc=0HSRsMcMeAcQ7kNvwEJrTd4&_nc_gid=bCcD6Ga_7Wqe5GnLxFRysw&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQAITcm8bk3msdbh2BIsKOiaK6P8wSu_M035jSvRyN9Cmg&oe=6A6BCF2D&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQNhzj7aXKntwJmXP48q6PStBjcf06GP24EA7XLBdM9Wtb1w-D4pyUezXldDpe5fqRcYI3FxxGEkGgSrFLvXpphVi1XLGvfV0SWz06c.mp4?_nc_cat=107&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ssn1-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=2sG29uAOJ8IQ7kNvwEhYF2G&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQ0xJUFMuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTc1MzEwNTU4MjY4MjU1NiwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjQsInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEwMDk5LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjoyMywidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=50b7854c9406fcd3&_nc_&_nc_gid=Mth8_RnR9R1LeXhNDx8Fig&_nc_ss=7c289&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQD3S6RvTBR0_zBZjrElwkb1Xwv0ArjoLVoqz3sVgUb04g&oe=6A67DF58", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "mama_mila_au", "song_name": "Original audio", "uses_original_audio": true, "should_mute_audio": false, "should_mute_audio_reason": "", "audio_id": "27391119593890765"}, "ownerUsername": "mama_mila_au", "ownerFullName": "Chantel Mila", "history": [{"date": "2026-07-26", "plays": 287612, "likes": 4796, "comments": 29}], "still_climbing": false, "transcript": "Have you ever walked into a hotel and thought, wow, it smells amazing? Here are five tips to make your room smell like that every day. Start with your mattress. Remove stains instantly with shaving cream, then vacuum it to remove dust mites and odours. Mix one cup water, one tablespoon of rubbing alcohol and vanilla oil to clean your bedside, and you can use this mix as a linen spray for ongoing fragrance. And you guys know how much I love to heat lemon, rosemary, cloven, vanilla to make your room smell incredible.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Question"}, {"shortCode": "DbDCjQLJmSy", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbDCjQLJmSy/", "caption": "What\u2019s the one kitchen mess you always struggle to get rid of? \ud83c\udf73 Save this video for your next kitchen deep clean! Grease and build up can feel like a never ending story but here are some quick tips to cut through kitchen grime using Earth Choice Power Degreaser \ud83e\uddfc I\u2019ve used Earth Choice for years (you may have spotted their dish liquid in my previous videos!) and I love that they\u2019re Aussie owned, free from harsh chemicals and use gentle, plant based ingredients. You can find it at your local Woolworths or independent supermarkets @earth.choice \ud83d\udc95 \n\n#tipsandtricks #kitchencleaning #cleaninghacks #cleaningtips #cleaningmo