r. Allow this to sit for 15 minutes to cut through tough grime. The stove top can be a grease magnet, but Earth Choice cuts through tough mess. I love that it's made with plant-based ingredients, so it's safe for food prep areas. And for greasy kitchen cabinets, you can spray it on a flat mop to clean tricky areas. It's Aussie made and owned and kills 99.9% of germs.", "is_relevant": true, "hook_type": "Secret Reveal / Breakdown"}, {"shortCode": "DbAbFqeSN4p", "url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DbAbFqeSN4p/", "caption": "Which of these spots are you guilty of skipping? \ud83d\udc40 The places we rarely clean are the ones that can be contributing to odours within your home. I love my Dyson Clean + Wash because it tackles both wet and dry messes at once, cutting cleaning time in half. It\u2019s so easy to use, with no heavy mop or bucket of water and even self cleans itself! The dirty water at the end says it all - I can\u2019t believe how much it picks up \ud83d\ude4c @dyson_anz \n\n#homehacks #cleaninghacks #tipsandtricks #homefragrance #cleaningtips", "timestamp": "2026-07-20T07:40:04.000Z", "videoDuration": 25.33300018310547, "videoPlayCount": 118053, "likesCount": -1, "commentsCount": 9, "displayUrl": "https://instagram.fein1-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/753361635_18101362706190993_652264788902738764_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=103&ig_cache_key=Mzk0NTI3MjQxMDAzNDk4NjUzNzE4MTAxMzYyNzAwMTkwOTkz.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEyMTkuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=BoOmdvirxC8Q7kNvwENVCfW&_nc_oc=Adrfy-_gRfnqMVmRtjgR0OX6OJxYdAI4D5G5SlrJ6YMH1HanJRmtow0hGBlcJfru6Cg&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fein1-2.fna&_nc_gid=SxNizWYJTa6TInXULPpWQQ&_nc_ss=72a8c&oh=00_AQBapI8G0e6nRAFGS_MmkIKJAMJOBmv9wyXrJp2xcT6XDg&oe=6A6BDC9A", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ham3-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQM10tLOv_xc6C9jy4mXDQihPgjuSvwvM6huoJLQp-lV1lHRPhXl2GZYzYcb30d7YY7VC4v7w3d8BmJ8agpV_5S4IsvLvWfzLRyCeTM.mp4?_nc_c