se your suitcase again with tip #6! \ud83c\udf0d\u2708\ufe0f Save this before your next trip! I\u2019ve used Samsonite suitcases for the last 10 years as I find they\u2019re the best quality and durability. Their new Paralux range is amazing as it comes with packing cubes that fit the suitcase perfectly, dual access opening (so you can access your stuff quickly without fully unpacking!) and even a built-in AirTag holder! Such a clever and practical design! Which tip did you not know? @samsonite_au @luxury.escapes \n\n#packinghacks #packwithme #traveltips #travelhacks", "timestamp": "2026-07-17T06:02:39.000Z", "videoDuration": 35.177, "videoPlayCount": 254909, "videoViewCount": null, "likesCount": 2142, "commentsCount": 56, "displayUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/v/t51.82787-15/754068839_18101650646190993_3731975340479742152_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e35_p1080x1080_sh2.08_tt6&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_cat=109&_nc_oc=Q6cZ2gG-dKFVgFoAp2dJs_FqOQORGrFlW_Q7hajiMf3Eh5KFitn6kPrkS_HbwpGCymAN0nyLKp17cyCxj5QNKoPzdFeV&_nc_ohc=Tc-kGsMeArsQ7kNvwEfPyyv&_nc_gid=sNO-TvEZoHNfwem21WpW-A&edm=ADp7STQBAAAA&ccb=7-5&oh=00_AQBm5oZYr7niDpoUf4qR1Gv7n_RZXn_52VlhvGKu5kud7g&oe=6A6BC4E7&_nc_sid=c6f216", "videoUrl": "https://scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m86/AQP1kQ2i54tIqsr8HCUI8SJmzAbKQ9ZJRD927pxVrEAbNLLE6QsTKNSTcgGedp50w_QW-fXjhQOpFrIWgNmlE-4KxarmQWFKND3LxcU.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=5e9851&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=lU9VAk8hJtEQ7kNvwEXaqqS&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5JTlNUQUdSQU0uQUQuQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfYmFzZWxpbmVfMV92MSIsInhwdl9hc3NldF9pZCI6MTA4NDQ0OTI1NDI2MjkwNSwiYXNzZXRfYWdlX2RheXMiOjksInZpX3VzZWNhc2VfaWQiOjEyMzc0LCJkdXJhdGlvbl9zIjozNSwidXJsZ2VuX3NvdXJjZSI6Ind3dyJ9&ccb=17-1&vs=8e2130426bc0ba89&_nc_&_nc_gid=0YsRVA4Mlg0NHab1UOkaxA&_nc_ss=72689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQB6tP2fombTUrvEhNmupIFYVmCmx-MXl4V2rU16M28QHg&oe=6A67EE16", "musicInfo": {"artist_name": "Alex Blue", "song_name": "Bet You Regret It", "uses_original_audio": fal